(text "Rev C: 60 x 60 mm / six-layer / double-sided PCB draft; rated operation and thermal capability remain unvalidated.\nIndependent comparators, latch and PWM gates retained; MCU added locally. No 24-pin controller cable or external brake-command cable.\nNo main-bus precharge/bleeder, USB, Hall or PFC/LLC power circuit. PFC power-board drawing is paused.\n3.3V single-ended encoder/SPI interfaces; exact external modules, connectors, passives, thermal and protection dynamics still need review." (at 20.32 250.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2e09b594-e9ea-52f9-8086-4a6c2c1eaa4b"))
